From 3e36db0f987411f764f131e0fb8fdd8545fa78b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien Delmas <adrien@adriendelmas.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 00:46:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 37/38] node interface: connectors, file pickers, checkboxes

A connector is only emitted for a socket Cycles accepts a link on. The
registry says so, and it matches exactly what Blender shows: on the
principled, distribution and subsurface_method are menus, not sockets.
Exposing them as inputs let graphs be built that would replay nowhere else.

surface_mix_weight is hidden: it is the internal mix weight Cycles carries on
every closure, which Blender never exposes since the Mix Shader node sets it.

The delegate now marks file names as asset paths and booleans with a checkBox
widget. Without these two pieces of metadata, a texture path had to be pasted
by hand and a boolean showed as a free integer field, where only zero and one
mean anything to Cycles.

The parameter sections become groupcollapsible: a plain group makes tabs and
throws everything left outside a folder into an Other tab, which is not
Blender's layout.

Bench replayed: 97 nodes, 0 problems, 96 change the image.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/hydra/sdr_cycles.cpp | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/hydra/sdr_cycles.cpp b/src/hydra/sdr_cycles.cpp
index 102a6f73..9337f7c3 100644
--- a/src/hydra/sdr_cycles.cpp
+++ b/src/hydra/sdr_cycles.cpp
@@ -167,6 +167,17 @@ SdrShaderPropertyUniquePtr MakeProperty(const ccl::SocketType &socket, const boo
   if (!socket.ui_name.empty()) {
     metadata[SdrPropertyMetadata->Label] = socket.ui_name.c_str();
   }
+  /* A boolean reaches USD as an integer, and nothing downstream can tell it
+   * apart from a count - a host would offer a free number field where only
+   * zero and one mean anything. Say so here. */
+  if (socket.type == ccl::SocketType::BOOLEAN) {
+    metadata[SdrPropertyMetadata->Widget] = "checkBox";
+  }
+  /* A filename is a file, not free text: hosts that know it can offer a file
+   * browser rather than asking for a path to be typed or pasted. */
+  if (socket.type == ccl::SocketType::STRING && socket.name == ccl::ustring("filename")) {
+    metadata[SdrPropertyMetadata->IsAssetIdentifier] = "1";
+  }
   /* Only sockets Cycles marks LINKABLE may take a connection. */
   if (!isOutput && (socket.flags & ccl::SocketType::LINKABLE) == 0) {
     metadata[SdrPropertyMetadata->Connectable] = "0";
